{:edb/db-before-t 2825 :edb/db-after-t 2826 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536138 50 #inst "2026-10-09T16:28:01.126Z" 13194139536138 true] [17592186096756 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385490 13194139536138 true] [17592186096756 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385497 13194139536138 true] [17592186096756 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385539 13194139536138 true] [17592186096756 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385546 13194139536138 true] [17592186096757 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385553 13194139536138 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385504 13194139536138 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385511 13194139536138 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385518 13194139536138 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385523 13194139536138 true] [17592186096758 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385528 13194139536138 true] [17592186096759 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385533 13194139536138 true] [17592186096759 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385560 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385491 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1089 "q-123292" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1100 "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩$, then $F(t)=$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1113 #uuid "811bbc59-9fc3-5b4b-bd9e-2e09752150a9" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385490 1145 "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{2t}+5,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int ({e}^{2t}+5)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t+1)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}+5t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t+1)⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vect