23294" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385497 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536138 true] [17592186385497 1100 "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385497 1113 #uuid "cbfe4f27-7d39-5346-b6c3-d28ca1cafdae" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385497 1145 "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}+2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{t}{4}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385499 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385500 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385501 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385502 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385503 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1041 "selection" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385501 13194139536138 true] [17592186385498 1110 #uuid "e341e2a8-13ea-5904-bea2-edfe43b7c86c" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385499 1034 "⟨{t}^{2}-4t,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385499 1111 #uuid "06c9e59c-e5b1-5b66-8dff-8168e82f57e7" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385500 1034 "⟨t+4,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385500 1111 #uuid "5cf1f19e-c81a-5fbe-a98b-1aac77e7abce" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385501 10