92186385505 1110 #uuid "45273d96-17c2-59e1-b8d5-9997c722bcb2" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385506 1034 "⟨-64,\\,2⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385506 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385506 1111 #uuid "217f889b-40e9-5117-9c1a-7962c88ff7bc" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385507 1034 "⟨-9,\\,4⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385507 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385507 1111 #uuid "6bc0bb24-336d-54e1-af65-536fe405ef60" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385508 1034 "⟨-45,\\,2⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385508 1111 #uuid "3432b9b6-ffa1-5971-810d-53c050a0c758" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385509 1034 "⟨-25,\\,4⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385509 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385509 1111 #uuid "b83685af-f58f-56af-b69e-0e538eb7513b" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385510 1034 "⟨-81,\\,4⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385510 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385510 1111 #uuid "b0af7050-c225-5710-92a0-deb4a76a81f8" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385512 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1089 "q-123517" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{6}⟨{e}^{-t},\\,4{t}^{2}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1113 #uuid "d8f25bbf-4e2b-5901-9f0f-91861655df78" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385511 1145 "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{6}⟨{e}^{-t},\\,4{t}^{2}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{6}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{0}^{6}4{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(-{e}^{-t}){|}_{0}^{6},\\,\\frac{4}{3}{t}^{3}\\,{|}_{0}^{6}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-{e}^{-6}+{e}^{-0},\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot {6}^{3}-\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot {0}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,288⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385513 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385514 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385515 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385516 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385517 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1041 "selection" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385516 13194139536138 true] [17592186385512 1110 #uuid "adc140a0-5f75-55cd-a5d9-e64fb4731044" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385513 1034 "⟨\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,128⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385513 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385513 1111 #uuid "31917785-faea-5f09-a0f2-559220ec0866" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385514 1034 "⟨6+\\frac{1}{e},\\,228⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385514 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385514 1111 #uuid "7e921d7c-99fd-515d-b253-81d5e45ec58b" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385515 1034 "⟨1-{e}^{3},\\,108⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385515 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385515 1111 #uuid "80fa8995-66fd-545f-b623-af02809e03c9" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385516 1034 "⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{6}},\\,288⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385516 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385516 1111 #uuid "04fdb09a-c318-5f03-bdc4-a424d6f68663" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385517 1034 "⟨1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{3}},\\,280⟩" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385517 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536138 true] [17592186385517 1111 #uuid "5249047e-e285-57a0-989e-60641a1995e7" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385519 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385521 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1089 "q-349112" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1100 "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1113 #uuid "784dba63-554b-55cc-8825-7f46d8c83131" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385518 1145 "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, let $u=3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t$, so $\\text{d}u={csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int -2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2),\\,2\\,(0-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385519 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385520 13194139536138 true] [17592186385519 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536138 true] [17592186385519 1041 "field-1" 13194139536138 true] [17592186385519 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385520 13194139536138 true] [17592186385519 1110 #uuid "b319d812-12ae-58e4-bcfd-41e0361de7f5" 13194139536138 tru